  "configuration_id": "config_031",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence is RNA-only multiprofile scvi_n200 (0.653 acc / 0.628 F1 with transformer, 0.650 / 0.628 with avgpool), while the only multimodal test so far (scvi + resnet50, avgpool, concat) underperforms RNA-only at 0.632 / 0.607. This creates uncertainty about whether the image modality is unhelpful or whether concat fusion is over-weighting a weak image representation. config_031 changes only fusion from concat to weighted in the same multimodal setup, directly testing whether learned weighting can make the image modality useful or confirm that resnet50 image features do not add value. This is a focused, high-information extension of the best RNA encoder/profile setting and avoids changing multiple factors at once."
}

